{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1000_037nao", "source_sha256": "62ce3accf6c7862126e5ccb152a0f460d8a926dd055404277664d88c2477433a", "ja": "ううっ、{$P$}さ～ん……！", "zh": "呜呜，{$P$}先～生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3f8a81c39440c1582cad51375fe99c2059406e74231460a395c9be69496ba320", "ja": "奈緒？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "奈绪？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "0d7eee7a80614f9c505ea6afa2ef5e6063ff0263de6d7f54362b414ca64e4227", "ja": "私、悲しい真実を知ってしもたんです～。\nほら、今日の私、アンパイア役やないですか？", "zh": "我明白了一件悲伤的事实～\n你看，我今天不是饰演Umpire吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1003_p", "source_sha256": "46f48fc07eb72657ce216ff7a64706328395a0f6aef3ff29b52a87cc8b41dc66", "ja": "ああ、ストライクバッターアウト……って、\nそれは審判！　今日の奈緒はヴァンパイア役だからな？", "zh": "嗯，三振出局……不对，那是裁判！\n今天奈绪是饰演Vampire，也就是吸血鬼吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "642761b5ede96073cf649dd99ffa4f1ad8a97693c26ddeca1e9db24164c950bf", "ja": "おおっ、さすが{$P$}さん！\nええ感じのノリツッコミやん♪", "zh": "哦哦，真不愧是{$P$}先生！\n很会先装傻再吐槽吼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c5c51a238cc74c5b31397912bc012f19afb8e15aaafb430c07b39ffff394680b", "ja": "ありがとう……いや、俺の芸人スキルの話はともかく、\n悲しい真実って？", "zh": "谢谢……不对，先别管我的搞笑技能了，\n你所谓悲伤的事实是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "c7d17ef6a0fd3cc31a5865bf2296f49dd3b0239a8d3816046db874429dc1f31b", "ja": "そう、それや！　私な、このヴァンパイア役、\nめっちゃ楽しんでたんですよ。", "zh": "对吼，我就是要讲这个啦！\n我啊，之前超期待这次能扮演吸血鬼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "fbf148e3854d93fe7ea7665006876510b5fa1b3a05eecead7f782ead0afcb4a2", "ja": "なんや強そうやし、服もカワイイし……。\nヴァンパイアになるんも悪ないな、とか思ったり。", "zh": "看起来很强，衣服又可爱……\n我就想说当吸血鬼好像也不赖吼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0677e4bbf44ace8711c0c0c894788ebe34315134c077441d65dae160ef6731b6", "ja": "そうか……\nすっかりヴァンパイア役にはまってたんだな。", "zh": "是这样啊……\n看来你很投入吸血鬼这个角色呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "72ea20eead935b7b023684d218cb8b3fdbf52be27f2d70c8782bacf2096bb061", "ja": "でもな。ヴァンパイアって……水が苦手らしいんです！\nそんなん、温泉に入られへんやん！", "zh": "不过吼，听说吸血鬼……好像会怕水耶！\n这样就不能泡温泉了呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "25f5b2837b9df9226def5afe8b5734eb0b2a389ddaca5a07530e4763473b3979", "ja": "もう、ヴァンパイアにはガッカリしました。\nもっと根性ある人らやと思ってたのに。", "zh": "吼喔，我对吸血鬼超失望的啊。\n我还以为会是一群更有骨气的人咧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6822cb900b817f6b6969f47e52e7a6003309098e593f3b2655b756446eab920c", "ja": "はは、なるほど。\nでも俺は、やっぱりちょっと憧れるけどな。", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。\n但我还是有点向往就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "50b234aa538b1afd5a5b9e3d23c3683b4574007f0a6967439c296d4c1e29371b", "ja": "えっ！？　温泉に入られへんのに！？", "zh": "咦！？那就不能泡温泉了耶！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1013_p", "source_sha256": "565edb8fb907f210891bd612993d42ce9ee63e33184d5ef3cf1ea9ae6dd16077", "ja": "たしかに温泉は惜しいが……最近、夜の仕事が多くて。\nヴァンパイアになったら、ちょっと楽かなって。", "zh": "不能泡温泉是很可惜……但我最近晚上的工作很多。\n要是真能变成吸血鬼，我可能会轻松一点吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "95e62bfddcd51bbad8b5f23060db7f700d6e1be1d7476730b0b01fb35e600ed6", "ja": "ふ～ん……あ、そしたら私がチュ～ってしましょうか！\nヴァンパイアになれるかもしれませんよ？", "zh": "这样喔……啊，不然我咬你一下吧！\n搞不好能变成吸血鬼喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3bd3906e314b2f8e74cf46a12c74abe9be1363e5091eb9f9df490d3e7ffa353a", "ja": "おっ、なるほど。\nそれじゃ遠慮なく……。", "zh": "哦，原来有这招。\n那就麻烦你了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "8d95996145f83639196b61a17fda9c1441a0260a2d743a2cc1426e8fc9f4c499", "ja": "ちょっ、じょ、冗談に決まってるやんか～！\nちょっとは照れてくれると思たのに……。", "zh": "等等，我、我当然是在开玩笑啊～！\n我还以为你会稍微害羞一下耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0063_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0063_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "9f4a84cc2047519d0ef8647cb248f565171e995bd05bb69804216a09f1d2f27e", "ja": "もう、{$P$}さんなんか知らんもん！\n人間のまま、ずーっと頑張ってくださいね！", "zh": "吼唷，我不理{$P$}先生了啦！\n你就继续当个人类，一～直努力下去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
